い性格で、自分にも他人にも厳しく、冷たいタイプに見られることもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事が苦手なくせに完璧で凛々しい母親を演じようと無理をして、いくつモノ失態を重ねた結果、圭太には本当の自分を見透かされてしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92550"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17803","sourceWorkId":"11057","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17803","sourceWorkId":"11057","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"60 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17803","sourceWorkId":"11057","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bb8df428a008819c0858b1f6042d08da515cf6d81876520518d27de23bdb5a1c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c02137d0fe66ac4aec99e2ce9dd2a5a3e763256c8ea7ec3b34f2e884520f090d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大久保藍子","creatorId":"vndb:s361","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s361","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s361","name":"大久保 藍子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:217793:92550:5075:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c2381","characterName":"三上 はるか","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"92552","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"217793"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17805"],"vndbCharacterId":"c2381"},"originalCharacterName":"三上 はるか","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"78"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She'd always liked Keita but she couldn't convey her feelings."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2381"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"隣に住む、圭太の幼馴染。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"素直になれないが、圭太の事をずっと好きで、今回、美女三人と圭太が同棲することを知って、いてもたってもいられず、短絡的に「ママハハ候補」に立候補。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、「親父がすきだったのか！」と、圭太には勘違いされたり、魅力的すぎる三人の候補に苦戦をしいられたりと、孤軍奮闘の毎日だが……？"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17805","sourceWorkId":"11057","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"圭太の隣人で、かつ幼なじみの少女。小さな頃から圭太のことが好きだが、気持ちを伝えられずにつらく当たってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"圭太が美女3人と同棲することを知り\"なんとかしなくては\"と、思わずママハハに立候補してしまう。圭太には\"親父が好きなんだ\"と勘違いされながらも、圭太の純真を守るために孤軍奮闘するのだが……。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92552"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17805","sourceWorkId":"11057","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"78 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17805","sourceWorkId":"11057","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17805","sourceWorkId":"11057","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2c9f03d850ccc4ae16aea989555cf1c0e23f7efc6d1b7253302d59a8af062d9f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0f3db0059c874a7a955905c253bdcecb888bfa576b622b78158357a5e46ec2bd.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"稲田佳乃香","creatorId":"vndb:s1659","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1659","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1659","name":"稲田 佳乃香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:217793:92552:6593:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c116841","characterN